it contained <em>an actual apology to Elton John</em> and the remarkable ne=
ws that the club=E2=80=99s trigger-happy owners have not already sent the I=
talian <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkL=
