B6;">the same way as an apple in Michael Owen=E2=80=99s house</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Having already made four managerial appoin=
tments in 2026 and 28 since the Pozzo family purchased the club in the summ=
er of 2012, the owners have shown uncharacteristic restraint despite Watfor=
d winning just three of the last 21 Championship games (even Oxford United =
have more victories in the division during that time despite being relegate=
d to League One in April). Pressure on Dionisi has now increased after John=
 =E2=80=93 which feels like an inappropriately underwhelming way to refer t=
o one of the most talented and flamboyant pop singers of all time =E2=80=93=
 admitted he was =E2=80=9Cupset=E2=80=9D at the club=E2=80=99s form in a no=
w-deleted post on a Social Media Disgrace on Sunday.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CAs a lifetime supporter of Watfor=
d FC, I am very upset and disappointed at the decline over the past few wee=
ks =E2=80=93 I really feel for the supporters who have to watch this,=E2=80=
=9D Elton crooned after <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com=
/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPg=
